WEBVTT

00:07.520 --> 00:08.650
<b>Give me a break.</b>

00:08.150 --> 00:09.900
<b>This is happening
because she doesn't have any.</b>

00:09.020 --> 00:10.900
<b>We kill her before the infection spreads.</b>

00:09.900 --> 00:11.320
<b>I said I'm on it.</b>

00:10.900 --> 00:12.650
<b>- Captain!
- Hurry!</b>

00:11.320 --> 00:13.030
<b>If we don't kill it, it'll kill us.</b>

00:12.650 --> 00:13.820
<b>You guys are family, aren't you?</b>

00:13.820 --> 00:15.320
<b>Get up there, Lily!</b>

00:24.170 --> 00:24.830
<b>Lily.</b>

00:25.880 --> 00:27.630
<b>You were groaning.</b>

00:27.630 --> 00:29.460
<b>Were you dreaming about something?</b>

00:31.170 --> 00:33.010
<b>We'll be proceeding on foot from here.</b>

00:33.010 --> 00:35.010
<b>We're counting on you
for continued guidance.</b>

00:37.340 --> 00:39.430
<b><i>That wasn't a dream.</i></b>

00:41.680 --> 00:43.430
<b><i>Those were my...</i></b>

00:45.350 --> 00:47.150
<b><i>my memories.</i></b>

02:21.660 --> 02:25.040
<b><i>Launching hostile machine lifeform
detection system.</i></b>

02:27.660 --> 02:29.920
<b>Is this another order from the Bunker?</b>

02:29.920 --> 02:31.880
<b>No, this is at my discretion.</b>

02:31.880 --> 02:36.050
<b>Setting up radars like this is a pain,
but it's important work.</b>

02:36.260 --> 02:37.380
<b>I see.</b>

02:37.920 --> 02:43.430
<b>Perhaps you're wondering if we can detect
machine lifeforms with a device like this?</b>

02:43.510 --> 02:45.100
<b>How should I answer that?</b>

02:45.470 --> 02:47.060
<b>- As you please.
- I am wondering.</b>

02:47.060 --> 02:48.100
<b>I knew it.</b>

02:48.310 --> 02:51.730
<b>But unfortunately for you, we can still
detect them with a device like this.</b>

02:51.850 --> 02:56.030
<b><i>Report. Hostile machine lifeform
detection system shutdown.</i></b>

02:56.030 --> 02:57.190
<b>What?</b>

02:58.360 --> 03:02.030
<b>Perhaps you're thinking, "You're taking
too long, Nines," or something?</b>

03:02.030 --> 03:03.160
<b>I'm not thinking that.</b>

03:03.160 --> 03:04.240
<b>I'm glad.</b>

03:04.240 --> 03:06.700
<b>I'm thinking,
"You're taking too long, 9S."</b>

03:06.700 --> 03:08.200
<b>Oh, wow.</b>

03:08.500 --> 03:10.210
<b>Pod, what's the reason?</b>

03:10.210 --> 03:13.790
<b><i>Report. Caused by an error
in installation No. 2.</i></b>

03:13.790 --> 03:15.840
<b>Oh, that far back?</b>

03:15.880 --> 03:18.590
<b>I'll go fix it right away,
so please proceed.</b>

03:18.590 --> 03:19.550
<b>Pod.</b>

03:26.970 --> 03:28.390
<b>I've been wondering.</b>

03:29.680 --> 03:31.350
<b>Why is it that until now,</b>

03:31.350 --> 03:35.770
<b>YoRHa Soldiers and the Resistance
never took a stance of formal cooperation?</b>

03:42.910 --> 03:44.370
<b>Hurry up and go.</b>

03:44.370 --> 03:47.330
<b>Yes, yes, I'll hurry.</b>

03:47.660 --> 03:53.330
<b>Lily, if you doze off because you're bored,
nightmares will haunt you again.</b>

03:55.710 --> 03:56.920
<b>What's wrong?</b>

04:01.220 --> 04:04.220
<b>Do we dream?</b>

04:04.720 --> 04:05.680
<b>We don't.</b>

04:09.640 --> 04:12.600
<b>There was a time
when we worked together.</b>

04:15.770 --> 04:19.980
<b>We Resistance
rescued a newer model of androids.</b>

04:20.400 --> 04:25.990
<b>During their descent for a top-secret operation,
they were assaulted by machine lifeforms.</b>

04:25.990 --> 04:28.030
<b>We met only four units.</b>

04:31.120 --> 04:34.170
<b>They said their squad name
was "YoRHa."</b>

04:35.370 --> 04:37.420
<b>The previous generation of YoRHa Soldiers.</b>

04:38.340 --> 04:41.130
<b>Why are you talking to me about this?</b>

04:41.260 --> 04:42.800
<b>I don't know why.</b>

04:44.090 --> 04:44.930
<b>But...</b>

04:48.430 --> 04:53.140
<b>When I look at you, I'm reminded of No. 2,
who was the leader of YoRHa.</b>

04:53.430 --> 04:56.940
<b>Because all No. 2 models
use the same synthetic body.</b>

04:57.230 --> 04:59.440
<b>That might be why I'm telling you this.</b>

05:01.900 --> 05:04.450
<b>YoRHa requested assistance.</b>

05:04.650 --> 05:07.700
<b>There was a server
for controlling machine lifeforms,</b>

05:07.700 --> 05:09.660
<b>and they wanted to destroy it.</b>

05:10.080 --> 05:13.540
<b>However, they had no backup from Command.
They were isolated and helpless.</b>

05:14.500 --> 05:18.040
<b>It was an operation that they couldn't
complete with just the four of them.</b>

05:18.250 --> 05:21.500
<b>The Resistance wasn't made aware
of anything like that.</b>

05:21.710 --> 05:24.050
<b>That's why we doubted them,
thinking it was an enemy trap.</b>

05:25.670 --> 05:29.510
<b>The situation looked like it will be a bloodbath,
but that was when No. 2 shouted...</b>

05:30.930 --> 05:33.560
<b>Right now, what we need are allies.</b>

05:34.850 --> 05:39.150
<b>It was the voice of someone
who still had hope,</b>

05:39.150 --> 05:42.150
<b>despite being crushed
by the hopelessness of the situation.</b>

05:42.780 --> 05:44.400
<b>That's why our captain...</b>

05:44.900 --> 05:47.530
<b>Enough.
No. 2, we'll head out on our own.</b>

05:47.530 --> 05:49.030
<b>- Huh? Wait...
- We’re wasting time.</b>

05:49.030 --> 05:49.950
<b>Wait.</b>

05:50.200 --> 05:51.330
<b>Listen.</b>

05:53.120 --> 05:57.620
<b>For the past few decades,
we've been fighting a war of attrition.</b>

05:58.500 --> 06:01.040
<b>With no clear measures to take,
we had no other option...</b>

06:02.750 --> 06:06.800
<b>but to spend our days where our comrades,
our family, gradually dwindled in number.</b>

06:07.170 --> 06:08.220
<b>By that...</b>

06:08.220 --> 06:11.550
<b>They were also denied their backup.
They're a squadron tossed aside.</b>

06:11.850 --> 06:13.720
<b>They're no different from us.</b>

06:13.970 --> 06:14.770
<b>However...</b>

06:14.770 --> 06:17.600
<b>Then, how are you going to fight
with those things in the Pacific Ocean?</b>

06:17.810 --> 06:22.190
<b>Will we continue this drawn-out battle
against infinitely multiplying machine lifeforms,</b>

06:22.190 --> 06:25.320
<b>and watch our family numbers
dwindle while doing nothing at all?</b>

06:28.780 --> 06:34.080
<b>What we need to do in this battlefield
is to not sit idly and simply survive.</b>

06:37.120 --> 06:38.580
<b>You're right.</b>

06:39.580 --> 06:43.630
<b>There's something we need to do
for all the family members that we've lost.</b>

06:44.710 --> 06:46.210
<b>That's the spirit.</b>

06:48.720 --> 06:53.220
<b>But these folks aren't our family.</b>

06:54.180 --> 06:57.680
<b>The enemy that YoRHa
needs to defeat is the same as ours.</b>

06:58.230 --> 06:59.310
<b>Right?</b>

07:07.490 --> 07:11.360
<b>The captain chose to fight alongside YoRHa.</b>

07:16.620 --> 07:18.040
<b>Am I not getting the point across?</b>

07:18.040 --> 07:19.210
<b>I get it.</b>

07:19.500 --> 07:21.420
<b>This is what you mean, right?</b>

07:21.420 --> 07:25.540
<b>If we go to the top of Mt. Ka'ala,
there will be an elevator hall.</b>

07:25.540 --> 07:27.920
<b>There's an entrance camouflaged as a rock.</b>

07:28.170 --> 07:30.670
<b>We found it with infrared analysis via satellite.</b>

07:30.670 --> 07:32.340
<b>We don't care about that.</b>

07:32.340 --> 07:36.600
<b>And the elevator heads straight down
underground from that landing.</b>

07:36.810 --> 07:40.940
<b>Straight down is not accurate.
Actually, it draws a helix—</b>

07:40.940 --> 07:43.940
<b>In any case, if we head down
with that elevator,</b>

07:43.940 --> 07:46.900
<b>we can clobber the server
of those machine lifeforms?</b>

07:46.900 --> 07:49.940
<b>If we don't, those guys
in the Pacific Ocean won't stop.</b>

07:50.190 --> 07:50.990
<b>That's right.</b>

07:52.780 --> 07:54.870
<b>How did you determine
the server's location?</b>

07:58.790 --> 08:03.250
<b>That is a military secret.
I cannot tell you.</b>

08:03.540 --> 08:05.540
<b>So the key part is a secret?</b>

08:05.630 --> 08:07.750
<b>Please understand.</b>

08:07.880 --> 08:12.470
<b>Captain Rose,
can we fight together with them like this?</b>

08:13.430 --> 08:15.640
<b>I can't trust them.</b>

08:16.050 --> 08:17.180
<b>Lily.</b>

08:18.350 --> 08:21.520
<b>When the time comes for you to become
the head of the household,</b>

08:22.600 --> 08:24.400
<b>you'll be making the same decision</b>

08:25.440 --> 08:28.150
<b>that I'm making right now.</b>

09:03.770 --> 09:05.350
<b>That’s a cute gun.</b>

09:15.490 --> 09:19.280
<b>Lily hates that gun
because it looks like a child's toy.</b>

09:19.280 --> 09:20.200
<b>So I see.</b>

09:20.200 --> 09:21.830
<b>I'm sorry, that was rude.</b>

09:21.830 --> 09:24.790
<b>Don't worry, Lily.
You’re fine the way you are.</b>

09:22.240 --> 09:23.450
<b>Don't mock her too much.</b>

09:23.450 --> 09:25.120
<b>I didn't mean to!</b>

09:25.250 --> 09:27.250
<b>Right, No. 21?</b>

09:28.250 --> 09:30.170
<b>I was faster!</b>

09:30.250 --> 09:31.710
<b>Admit defeat.</b>

09:31.710 --> 09:33.840
<b>Give me a break! That was
an overwhelming defeat for you.</b>

09:32.840 --> 09:34.720
<b>Hey, what are they doing?</b>

09:33.840 --> 09:35.420
<b>Huh? Wanna go at it?</b>

09:34.970 --> 09:36.720
<b>A race to fill water.</b>

09:39.180 --> 09:40.720
<b>Stop it, both of you.</b>

09:40.720 --> 09:42.640
<b>Please calm down!</b>

09:42.640 --> 09:44.100
<b>That's enough.</b>

09:49.980 --> 09:51.440
<b>That was delicious.</b>

09:51.440 --> 09:53.110
<b>She drank it all.</b>

09:53.230 --> 09:54.820
<b>More, please.</b>

09:56.820 --> 09:58.740
<b>Round Two?</b>

10:17.800 --> 10:19.090
<b>Captain Rose.</b>

10:20.300 --> 10:21.300
<b>Lily is...</b>

10:34.070 --> 10:37.150
<b>I was infected with the enemy logic-virus.</b>

10:37.740 --> 10:41.950
<b>If left alone, it would overwrite my data,
take over my body, and that would be the end.</b>

10:42.160 --> 10:46.000
<b>There's no cure once you get infected, so...</b>

10:46.290 --> 10:47.710
<b>Are you really going to shoot her?</b>

10:48.000 --> 10:50.080
<b>We kill her before the infection spreads.</b>

10:50.170 --> 10:51.540
<b>That's what we've always done.</b>

10:51.750 --> 10:53.250
<b>If we don't kill it, it'll kill us.</b>

10:53.250 --> 10:54.340
<b>But...</b>

10:54.340 --> 10:56.260
<b>What about shields? They aren't working?</b>

10:56.260 --> 10:58.380
<b>This is happening
because she doesn't have any.</b>

11:13.480 --> 11:14.980
<b>What power...</b>

11:14.980 --> 11:17.480
<b>No. 4, No. 16, hold her down.</b>

11:18.190 --> 11:19.530
<b>No. 21.</b>

11:20.030 --> 11:21.450
<b>Please cure Lily.</b>

11:22.530 --> 11:24.240
<b>That's impossible!</b>

11:25.870 --> 11:29.410
<b>If we don't hurry,
she’ll become unmanageable.</b>

11:29.500 --> 11:30.750
<b>Captain!</b>

11:30.920 --> 11:32.170
<b>Forgive me.</b>

11:32.630 --> 11:33.750
<b>Lily.</b>

11:40.840 --> 11:42.430
<b>You guys are family, aren't you?</b>

11:52.310 --> 11:53.230
<b>Wait!</b>

11:53.230 --> 11:54.770
<b>Get back here!</b>

11:59.690 --> 12:01.320
<b>Damn this ridiculous power.</b>

12:01.320 --> 12:02.700
<b>Stay still already!</b>

12:05.490 --> 12:07.160
<b>Reprogramming. Start.</b>

12:07.370 --> 12:09.160
<b>Don't get close. You'll get infected!</b>

12:09.160 --> 12:11.210
<b>Shut up! Lower that gun!</b>

12:12.040 --> 12:12.870
<b>Captain.</b>

12:17.380 --> 12:19.420
<b>Not yet, No. 21?</b>

12:19.670 --> 12:21.920
<b>I'm not sure if I can do this
under these circum—</b>

12:25.800 --> 12:26.680
<b>Stop it!</b>

12:28.720 --> 12:31.890
<b>Because I wasn't made for combat,
everyone keeps protecting me.</b>

12:33.190 --> 12:35.770
<b>I want to save everyone else
just as much!</b>

12:51.950 --> 12:53.250
<b>Captain.</b>

12:54.460 --> 12:59.460
<b>I don't want to lose comrades...
and Lily, anymore.</b>

13:00.800 --> 13:02.010
<b>I...</b>

13:02.340 --> 13:04.880
<b>Rose, believe in your comrades.</b>

13:04.880 --> 13:08.180
<b>It's the captain's job
to protect your comrades, right?</b>

13:08.180 --> 13:11.180
<b>Vaccine installed.
Launching virus removal program.</b>

13:11.180 --> 13:12.520
<b>Hurry!</b>

13:12.520 --> 13:14.980
<b>Just a bit more.
Everyone, keep at it!</b>

13:16.650 --> 13:18.480
<b>Forcing system restart.</b>

13:27.820 --> 13:28.990
<b>Lily?</b>

13:31.370 --> 13:32.410
<b>Lily.</b>

13:33.750 --> 13:34.910
<b>Lily!</b>

13:36.670 --> 13:37.830
<b>Lily?</b>

13:38.750 --> 13:40.040
<b>Lily!</b>

13:49.800 --> 13:50.890
<b>Lily.</b>

13:54.140 --> 13:57.270
<b>Everyone saved me.</b>

13:59.860 --> 14:01.690
<b>No. 2 helped to save me.</b>

14:03.730 --> 14:06.240
<b>And what happened to the operation?</b>

14:06.240 --> 14:12.450
<b>By the time we approached the server area,
300,000 enemy units had already converged.</b>

14:12.450 --> 14:15.330
<b>300,000? What about backup?</b>

14:16.210 --> 14:17.870
<b>Of course there were none.</b>

14:17.870 --> 14:20.380
<b>That's how those guys
on the moon do things.</b>

14:20.960 --> 14:23.210
<b>Was the operation a failure?</b>

14:23.210 --> 14:26.170
<b>If it failed, I wouldn't be here, would I?</b>

14:26.550 --> 14:30.140
<b>Then all the comrades from back then
are still around somewhere?</b>

14:36.890 --> 14:39.270
<b>We were sacrificial pawns.</b>

14:41.690 --> 14:42.940
<b><i>I repeat.</i></b>

14:42.980 --> 14:47.190
<b><i>YoRHa Soldiers, please promptly head
to the elevator with the current forces on hand.</i></b>

14:47.530 --> 14:50.200
<b><i>Give me a break.
Hurry up and send us some backup!</i></b>

14:50.200 --> 14:51.280
<b><i>Where is the Commander?</i></b>

14:51.280 --> 14:52.990
<b><i>I request a reply from the Commander!</i></b>

14:52.990 --> 14:55.870
<b>This is a direct order
from the Commander.</b>

14:56.120 --> 14:57.660
<b><i>That can't be...</i></b>

14:57.660 --> 15:00.540
<b><i>Please! Get another
confirmation from the Comman—</i></b>

15:01.000 --> 15:03.290
<b>Command. Command!</b>

15:06.800 --> 15:08.130
<b>We're going to engage.</b>

15:16.020 --> 15:16.930
<b>Now!</b>

15:16.930 --> 15:18.350
<b>Serves you right.</b>

15:26.940 --> 15:28.070
<b>Gerbera, get a—</b>

15:31.570 --> 15:32.660
<b>Look out, Lily!</b>

15:48.710 --> 15:51.590
<b>Captain, please go on ahead.
I will hold them off.</b>

15:51.720 --> 15:54.220
<b>Stop that, idiot. You can't win
against this many of them.</b>

15:54.390 --> 15:57.140
<b>I don't wanna hear anything logical
coming from your mouth.</b>

15:57.430 --> 15:59.430
<b>Then I’ll remain here with you.</b>

16:00.600 --> 16:03.020
<b>I can't leave this
in the hands of one idiot.</b>

16:05.520 --> 16:07.070
<b>Who's the idiot?</b>

16:08.860 --> 16:11.030
<b>YoRHa Soldier, Gunner No. 16.</b>

16:11.030 --> 16:15.660
<b>Entering enemy squad feint attack mission
on Mt. Ka'ala with the Resistance.</b>

16:15.660 --> 16:16.530
<b>But...</b>

16:16.530 --> 16:18.290
<b>No! Both of you will die, too.</b>

16:19.950 --> 16:22.330
<b>If I'm with her,
I won't die all that easily.</b>

16:22.330 --> 16:25.170
<b>Don't drag me down, idiot.</b>

16:27.290 --> 16:28.840
<b>Now go!</b>

16:34.680 --> 16:36.390
<b>The elevator is not functioning.</b>

16:36.680 --> 16:38.760
<b>The enemy has placed
a protective program on it.</b>

16:38.760 --> 16:40.020
<b>We must remove that blockage.</b>

16:40.100 --> 16:41.350
<b>Hurry up and remove it.</b>

16:41.350 --> 16:42.310
<b>I'm on it now.</b>

16:42.310 --> 16:44.520
<b>There are limits on how long
the guys outside can hold.</b>

16:44.940 --> 16:46.360
<b>I said I'm on it.</b>

16:49.230 --> 16:50.230
<b>They're coming.</b>

16:56.700 --> 16:57.490
<b>It opened.</b>

16:57.950 --> 16:59.160
<b>Okay, hurry.</b>

17:05.120 --> 17:08.540
<b>I will remain here and continue hacking.
Please go on ahead.</b>

17:08.540 --> 17:09.420
<b>Why?</b>

17:09.420 --> 17:11.670
<b>If I interrupt this operation,
the elevator will not move.</b>

17:11.670 --> 17:13.760
<b>What? You're going to stay here alone?</b>

17:13.760 --> 17:14.800
<b>Just hurry up.</b>

17:16.510 --> 17:18.180
<b>The enemy is closing in.</b>

17:19.720 --> 17:22.810
<b>I'll remain here and protect No. 21.</b>

17:22.930 --> 17:23.730
<b>Anemone!</b>

17:23.730 --> 17:25.440
<b>I'm trusting you with the server.</b>

17:28.230 --> 17:30.940
<b>No. 21 has been infected.</b>

17:32.230 --> 17:33.860
<b>Anemone has noticed as well.</b>

17:34.240 --> 17:36.320
<b>Don't waste their determination.</b>

17:42.240 --> 17:43.700
<b>It's my fault.</b>

17:43.700 --> 17:46.750
<b>No. 21 will be able to remove the virus.</b>

17:46.830 --> 17:48.250
<b>I hope so.</b>

17:49.380 --> 17:52.670
<b>I'm having a nightmare.</b>

17:54.050 --> 17:56.970
<b>Do we dream?</b>

17:58.550 --> 17:59.550
<b>We don't.</b>

18:06.390 --> 18:08.150
<b>It would be nice if it was a dream.</b>

18:18.660 --> 18:22.540
<b>Then we engaged in combat with the enemy
that was at the server,</b>

18:22.540 --> 18:25.700
<b>and Captain Rose
was injured covering for me.</b>

18:26.250 --> 18:30.630
<b>That's why I think No. 2
made us go back to the elevator.</b>

18:30.630 --> 18:32.750
<b>She told us two to evacuate.</b>

18:33.960 --> 18:38.050
<b>I don't remember all too well.
What remains in my memory is...</b>

18:43.140 --> 18:44.720
<b>Captain Rose?</b>

18:44.970 --> 18:46.270
<b>You should go alone.</b>

18:47.430 --> 18:50.230
<b>We'll do something about the server
by the time you make it up.</b>

18:50.230 --> 18:51.520
<b>Captain?</b>

18:51.520 --> 18:54.650
<b>I still want you
to keep thinking about the future.</b>

18:54.860 --> 18:56.570
<b>No! Captain, come with—</b>

18:56.570 --> 18:58.570
<b>Get up there, Lily!</b>

19:01.740 --> 19:03.240
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

19:04.620 --> 19:08.000
<b>Because I was here, everyone...</b>

19:20.220 --> 19:22.050
<b>You're going to save everyone, right?</b>

19:22.430 --> 19:23.970
<b>Then don't forget.</b>

19:24.350 --> 19:26.100
<b>Engrave it into your memory.</b>

19:43.740 --> 19:46.580
<b>Use that to protect.</b>

19:57.380 --> 19:58.710
<b>I won't forget.</b>

20:01.130 --> 20:02.510
<b>All of you.</b>

20:03.090 --> 20:04.970
<b>How we were together.</b>

20:05.640 --> 20:06.970
<b>How we fought.</b>

20:07.970 --> 20:09.850
<b>How you saved me.</b>

20:11.140 --> 20:13.230
<b>I will never forget!</b>

20:17.270 --> 20:21.450
<b>We androids don't dream,
and we have no souls.</b>

20:22.150 --> 20:24.070
<b>But our memories are genuine.</b>

20:24.780 --> 20:28.040
<b>The memories from back then
form who you are now.</b>

20:28.870 --> 20:30.870
<b>You're quite calm.</b>

20:32.040 --> 20:35.750
<b>What kind of memories do you have, 2B?</b>

20:44.680 --> 20:46.430
<b>What if one of your comrades
from back then</b>

20:46.970 --> 20:50.020
<b>was somewhere out there
right now, and still alive?</b>

20:53.480 --> 20:57.150
<b>That’s a nice dream to have.</b>

22:40.630 --> 22:43.050
<b>POD 042 REPORTING TO ALL OF MANKIND.</b>

22:40.630 --> 22:43.050
<b>WE WILL NOW EXECUTE THE TASK
OF INTRODUCING THE MULTIPLE ENDINGS
FOR THE VIDEO GAME "NIER:AUTOMATA." OVER.</b>

22:44.130 --> 22:46.220
<b>PUPPET PLAY
NIER:AUTOMATA
“ADAM AND EVE”</b>

22:52.430 --> 22:57.810
<b>Hey, Brother.
What's with these outfits?</b>

22:57.810 --> 23:03.070
<b>It is said humans wear clothing classified
as "uniforms" when they gain knowledge.</b>

23:03.070 --> 23:05.650
<b>And call me "elder brother,"
not "brother."</b>

23:05.650 --> 23:07.860
<b>So that's it.
Figures you'd know, Brother.</b>

23:07.860 --> 23:08.860
<b>"Elder Brother."</b>

23:09.030 --> 23:12.950
<b>Is that interesting?
Maybe I'll try reading it later.</b>

23:12.950 --> 23:15.620
<b>Can we go play
when you're done reading that?</b>

23:15.620 --> 23:20.290
<b>I found a secret base underground.
It's like a withered plant bulb.</b>

23:20.290 --> 23:25.590
<b>Brother, come on, come on,
come on, Brother.</b>

23:25.590 --> 23:27.510
<b>Mackerels bite with every cast.</b>

23:27.510 --> 23:30.340
<b>Huh? Brother?
Where are you going?</b>

23:30.340 --> 23:32.930
<b>Hey. Hey!</b>

23:34.180 --> 23:36.930
<b>Fed up, Adam left the camp to its fate and decided to...
Go fishing?
Yeah, that's it. Fishing.
With a smile on his face, he packed up
and headed for the coast.</b>

23:37.680 --> 23:40.020
<b>TO BE CONTINUED</b>
